 293:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c **** /**
 294:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * Checks if the offered IP address is already in use.
 295:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
 296:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * It does so by sending an ARP request for the offered address and
 297:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * entering CHECKING state. If no ARP reply is received within a small
 298:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * interval, the address is assumed to be free for use by us.
 299:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
 300:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @param netif the netif under DHCP control
